# Ghalta, Primal Hunger {10}{G}{G}: "This spell costs {X} less to cast, where X is the total power of creatures you control." The
# ruling: "If a creature's power is somehow less than 0, it subtracts from the total power of your other creatures." Bot1 controls a
# Memnite (power 1) and an Aegis Turtle under Weakness (power -2): the total is -1, so X is 0 (CR 107.1b) and Ghalta costs all twelve.
# Counting the Turtle as 0 would make X = 1 and let the eleven mana of three Black Lotuses and two Moxen pay; it is refused, and a
# third Mox makes twelve.

